- content_for :title, "ディレクトリ・メモ管理"

ruby:
  by_parent = memo_directory_nav_children_index(@memo_directories_for_nav || [])
  roots = memo_directory_nav_tree_roots(@memo_directories_for_nav || [], by_parent)
  current_dir = @current_memo_directory
  filter_dir_id = current_dir&.root? ? nil : current_dir&.id

.mb-4.flex.flex-wrap.items-start.justify-between.gap-3
  .min-w-0
    h1.text-xl.font-semibold.kb-text-primary 日付フォルダ・メモ管理
    p.mt-1.text-sm.kb-text-secondary
      | 左で日付フォルダを選び、右の一覧でメモにチェックを入れて一括操作します。
  = link_to "メモ一覧へ戻る", memos_path(memo_directory_id: filter_dir_id), class: "kb-chrome-btn-secondary kb-btn-sm shrink-0", data: { turbo: false }

.flex.flex-col.gap-4 class="md:flex-row md:items-start"
  aside class="kb-card w-full shrink-0 p-3 md:w-72 md:sticky md:top-4"
    p.mb-2.text-xs.font-medium.uppercase.tracking-wide.kb-text-muted 日付フォルダ
    ul.space-y-0.5
      - roots.each do |dir|
        = render "memos/manage_directory_branch", dir: dir, by_parent: by_parent, current_directory: current_dir

  section.min-w-0.flex-1 data-controller="memo-bulk-manage"
    - if current_dir.nil? || current_dir.root?
      .kb-card.p-8.text-center.text-sm.kb-text-muted
        p 左の日付フォルダを選ぶと、その中のメモを管理できます。
    - else
      = render "memos/manage_bulk_bar", filter_dir_id: filter_dir_id, notebooks: @notebooks
      = render "memos/manage_memo_list", memos: @memos
